  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Financiamiento de Soluciones Habitacionales de la Poblaci&#xF3;n de la Econom&#xED;a Popular y Solidaria (EPS)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing of Housing Solutions for the Popular and Solidarity Economy Population (EPS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">El objetivo general de la primera operaci&#xF3;n es atender las necesidades de vivienda de la poblaci&#xF3;n de la EPS a trav&#xE9;s de la provisi&#xF3;n de recursos financieros a las Organizaciones del Sector Financiero Popular y Solidario (OSFPS), as&#xED; como contribuir al desarrollo de mercados de financiamiento de vivienda con enfoque de sostenibilidad y de inclusi&#xF3;n financiera a mujeres, personas con discapacidad y pueblos y nacionalidades, entre otros. El objetivo espec&#xED;fico de la primera operaci&#xF3;n es expandir la atenci&#xF3;n a las necesidades de vivienda de la poblaci&#xF3;n de la EPS a trav&#xE9;s del financiamiento de las OSFPS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The general objective of the first operation is to to meet the housing needs of the HPS population through the provision of financial resources to the Popular and Solidarity Financial Sector Organizations (OSFPS), as well as to contribute to the development of housing finance markets with a focus on sustainability and financial inclusion for women, people with disabilities, and peoples and nationalities, among others. The specific objective of the first operation is to expand the attention to the housing needs of the population of the EPS through the financing of the OSFPS.</narrative>
  </description>
